{
  "tema": 5258,
  "slug": "lei-leyo",
  "titulo": "Leer, creer and proveer in the preterite",
  "subtitulo": "Leí el libro; ella no lo creyó.",
  "foto": "t05.jpg",
  "regla": "In the preterite, leer, creer and proveer change the i to y in él/ella/usted and ellos/ellas/ustedes (leyó, leyeron). The other persons keep the i with an accent: leí, leíste, leímos.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Leer**, **creer**, **proveer** (and **poseer**) have a stem ending in a vowel (**le-**, **cre-**, **prove-**)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "In **él / ella / usted** and **ellos / ellas / ustedes**, the **i** of the ending becomes **y**: **leyó**, **leyeron**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "In **yo**, **tú** and **nosotros**, the **i** stays and gets a **written accent**: **leí**, **leíste**, **leímos**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "leer",
            "creer",
            "proveer"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "leí",
              "creí",
              "proveí"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "leíste",
              "creíste",
              "proveíste"
            ],
            [
              "él / ella / usted",
              "leyó",
              "creyó",
              "proveyó"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros / nosotras",
              "leímos",
              "creímos",
              "proveímos"
            ],
            [
              "ellos / ellas / ustedes",
              "leyeron",
              "creyeron",
              "proveyeron"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The **y** never appears in yo, tú or nosotros: **leímos**, never **leyimos**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: three vowels in a row (**le-i-ó**) won't fit, so the middle one turns into **y**: **le-yó**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Anoche ==leí== tres capítulos de The Expanse.",
              "en": "Last night I read three chapters of The Expanse."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Leíste== el mensaje del entrenador?",
              "en": "Did you read the coach's message?"
            },
            {
              "es": "Naomi no le ==creyó== a Holden al principio.",
              "en": "Naomi didn't believe Holden at first."
            },
            {
              "es": "Nosotros no ==creímos== el pronóstico y fuimos a surfear.",
              "en": "We didn't believe the forecast and went surfing."
            },
            {
              "es": "Los clientes ==leyeron== las reseñas antes de venir.",
              "en": "The customers read the reviews before coming."
            },
            {
              "es": "La estación Tycho ==proveyó== las piezas para la nave.",
              "en": "Tycho Station supplied the parts for the ship."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi abuela nunca ==creyó== en la mala suerte.",
              "en": "My grandma never believed in bad luck."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Ustedes ==leyeron== las instrucciones del abono?",
              "en": "Did you all read the fertilizer instructions?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
